FitRing is a data and service application for Bluetooth wearable devices.

Provide users with a unified and convenient intelligent use experience.

With FitRing, you can:

1) Record daily activities and sleep data;

2) You can set exercise and sleep goals to maintain active exercise and adequate sleep every day;

3) Make statistics of the historical data of the day, week and month, and record their own changes;

4) Massive dial appearance for you to choose, and support customization to show your personality;
